{"3824740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axel Quest", "steam_appid": 3824740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/642084cb6974f7ba7e4a4ace727abdbc.avif?t=1774464242\" width=674 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axel Quest is a retro-style action-adventure with Metroidvania elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted pixel-art world, fight deadly monsters, defeat powerful bosses, and discover new paths as you progress. Along the journey, you'll collect equipment, meet helpful NPCs, and uncover hidden secrets that reward your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls and fast-paced gameplay, Axel Quest offers a nostalgic experience inspired by classic 2D games, designed for both newcomers and seasoned players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.poster.avif?t=1774464242\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.webm?t=1774464242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.mp4?t=1774464242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword-based combat with responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas and hidden paths to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs and shops to upgrade your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for gamepad and keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art visuals and retro soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Axel Quest to your wishlist and get ready for an epic adventure!</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/642084cb6974f7ba7e4a4ace727abdbc.avif?t=1774464242\" width=674 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axel Quest is a retro-style action-adventure with Metroidvania elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted pixel-art world, fight deadly monsters, defeat powerful bosses, and discover new paths as you progress. Along the journey, you'll collect equipment, meet helpful NPCs, and uncover hidden secrets that reward your curiosity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls and fast-paced gameplay, Axel Quest offers a nostalgic experience inspired by classic 2D games, designed for both newcomers and seasoned players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.poster.avif?t=1774464242\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.webm?t=1774464242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/extras/3d91dc85ebef08df13e0ac3f22262424.mp4?t=1774464242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sword-based combat with responsive controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret areas and hidden paths to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs and shops to upgrade your equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full support for gamepad and keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art visuals and retro soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add Axel Quest to your wishlist and get ready for an epic adventure!</strong></p>", "short_description": "A 2D action-adventure game with Metroidvania elements. Explore, fight monsters, collect equipment, unlock new paths, and challenge bosses in a handcrafted pixel-art world inspired by retro classics.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/c86e860ed5a1edf5c1cc6fefa80dd7917d614446/header.jpg?t=1774464242", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/0379956a54aa7c57b71058418f3dd768ace54106/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774464242", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824740/0379956a54aa7c57b71058418f3dd768ace54106/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774464242", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><